{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/74672d8dfd54ede9d4253865c390810a.avif?t=1773699915\" alt=\"Cozy bag packing\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras_big/74672d8dfd54ede9d4253865c390810a.webp?t=1773699915 width=1560 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stack, sort, and <i>squeeze</i> everyday objects into oddly shaped spaces just the way you like with physics, jiggling, and the satisfaction of fitting things neatly into place :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.poster.avif?t=1773699915\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.webm?t=1773699915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.mp4?t=1773699915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/cf9ae67604f3d04f47588a84a64d5cc9.avif?t=1773699915\" alt=\"Odd items, bags, and personalities\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras_big/cf9ae67604f3d04f47588a84a64d5cc9.webp?t=1773699915 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Balls bounce, geckos stick, and <strong>pizza can be eaten!</strong> Some bags swing, some even spin, and some aren't bags at all! Piece together the person behind every bag through the things they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/dc6b12c0053f723fd24da9fc00225ca4.poster.avif?t=1773699915\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/dc6b12c0053f723fd24da9fc00225ca4.webm?t=1773699915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/7e2fb6abc8269aaae9ddc8f77c734247.avif?t=1773699915\" alt=\"Pack with friends\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras_big/7e2fb6abc8269aaae9ddc8f77c734247.webp?t=1773699915 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or cozy up with friends! Supports up to 4 players in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/be45cefeab7551db81387fe00560290d.poster.avif?t=1773699915\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/be45cefeab7551db81387fe00560290d.webm?t=1773699915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extr